// expect: refuse E_DuplicateFnName
// A program's declaration of a name the linked library declares: the link is
// one namespace today, so the second `fn count` refuses naming the first,
// link-wide. The selective import that would settle the collision at the
// import edge, E_ImportNameCollision, is the module-as-a-scope landing's.
fn count(xs) = len(xs)

fn main() = count([1, 2, 3])
